	(text "Control logic. U10: DO transceiver direction is the complement of the DI direction. U11/U12: while the front panel pulls SSW_DSB* low the cable transceiver U9 turns towards the FPGA and the DI transceiver is disabled in hardware (no FPGA latency). U13 + JP1: on-board MWRT = pWR* NOR sOUT for systems without a front panel; leave JP1 open in an IMSAI (the CP-A drives MWRITE)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
